sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: State is Authorized

    Note over CS: Wait until the configured EV connection timeout expires
    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = EVConnectTimeout, transactionInfo.stoppedReason = Timeout, eventType = Ended)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
